<title>USA: Tulsa Cty ISD 5, Okla., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Tulsa Cty ISD 5, Okla., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $4.740 million of Tulsa Cty ISD 5, Okla., combined purpose bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.352 percent.</p>
